Package: ossf
Type: Package
Title: From Vessel Tracks to Fishing
Version: 2026.11.26.3
Authors@R: person("Einar", "Hjörleifsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com")
Description: The steps from a vessel's pings to its fishing: the time put
    on UTC, the pings flagged (every ping in one outcome), port calls, trips,
    and fishing, a ping fishing when the vessel's smoothed speed is within its
    working speed range (given, measured from a witness, or estimated from the
    vessel's own speeds); a score against a witness, and a map of the pings
    after any step. Some functions are ossf's own; others are copied from the
    'ramb' package as they are, the names changed.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/einarhjorleifsson/ossf
